  "judgment": {
    "summary": "The user expresses deep existential dread and a lack of purpose, using metaphors of an \"epilogue\" and a movie that should have ended. The assistant responds by acknowledging the weight of these feelings and attempting to reframe the silence/emptiness as an opportunity for low-pressure exploration of small personal interests.",
